{"title":"2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/e/e1ec41b16027f3e4963103a3850af9a52b107030.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/c/decc5bbe3f830f2d09ea5f89a5d17b4e347ed0be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />, the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/b/9cb84f78e824963c5609a057214128b8c7776183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\odot$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" /> is defined by\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c86f09997fed1e33a4dde7b7553c34887f3eaed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a \\odot b = \\sqrt{a + 4b}\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0ef83399e7b3fd35ae77d783905c0155552e76eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\odot 1 = \\sqrt{5 + 4(1)} = \\sqrt{9} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"230\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1a\">2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1b\" title=\"2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1b\">2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1c\" title=\"2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1c\">2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1c</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1d&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1d (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1d</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017234729\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1263/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35593:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017234729 and revision id 278007. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}